sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Seller as Seller (Registered User)
    participant API as ListingRoutes & AuthMiddleware
    participant Ctrl as ListingController
    participant Svc as ListingService
    participant DB as ListingModel (MongoDB)

    Seller->>API: POST /api/v1/listings { title, brand, model, price, condition, city, ... }
    API->>API: Verify JWT cookie / header
    API->>API: Validate input schema (price > 0, required fields)
    API->>Ctrl: createListing(req, res)
    Ctrl->>Svc: createListing(sellerId, listingData)
    Svc->>DB: create({ ...listingData, sellerId, status: 'ACTIVE' })
    DB-->>Svc: newListing document
    Svc-->>Ctrl: newListing
    Ctrl-->>Seller: 201 Created { success: true, data: newListing }

    Seller->>API: POST /api/v1/listings/:id/images (multipart/form-data)
    API->>API: Multer MIME & File Size Check (<= 8MB, jpg/png/webp)
    API->>Ctrl: uploadImages(req, res)
    Ctrl->>Svc: addListingImages(listingId, sellerId, fileUrls)
    Svc->>DB: findOne({ _id: listingId, sellerId })
    DB-->>Svc: listing
    Svc->>DB: updateOne({ _id: listingId }, { $push: { images: { $each: fileUrls } } })
    DB-->>Svc: updated
    Svc-->>Ctrl: updatedListing
    Ctrl-->>Seller: 200 OK { success: true, data: updatedListing }
